Z||000141||p4n1c||01-30-2001||11:17 PM||||My take on this whole thing if she is for real, which after reading her responses is probably true.  Or the person that made this up went to a lot of trouble of thinking stuff up.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>She is not desperate persay.  She's on the look out for someone that holds similar interests and is a "nice" guy, since in her first post she said "And yes, we've got to keep in all with in our own groups.. The good ones are hard to find!".  <P>But the thing about liking a guy that has a red '86 GT?  That threw me for a loop.<P>I don't know if she's looking for a guy with a personality or someone that just has a red '86.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  And then asking to be introduced to everyone mentioned.  That's fringing on the desperate but bordering on wanting to have a group of guys to prod for details and pick one from that, that may have matching personality to her tastes, etc.<P>Well, we'll see.  And it must all make people wonder if I'm just doing this.  lol.  Trust me I thought of that, and I would be one sick puppy if I did.  I wouldn't drag Steve(Darklord) along if I was pulling this crap though.<P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>"Each passing day, every passing face seems like such a blur" <BR>- The Offspring(Million Miles Away)||||reg||1
