Z||000143||BigBoyToys||01-30-2001||11:59 PM||||ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO  ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO  ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO ROFLMFAO  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Stop my gut hurts so bad, you're killing me!!!!<P>Since I was the first to cast the shadow of doubt on this fine thread I sincerly apologize to you HOTTIE (aka Jessica)!!!<P>To prove my sincerity I shall have my assistant Alfred fuel up the Lear and get the appropriate flight clearances for my trip to<BR>your fair city of Toronto. I shall do my best to find a super stretch RED Fiero GT limo so that I to can greet you in style (I do hope you will not be to disappointed if the limo is a standard white stretch limo (kinda short notice to have one built to order)). So that you will know me from the crowd I will be the young gentleman with the four dozen mixed color long stem roses and four dozen balloons. <P>Unless you prefer that I trailer my three T-Top 1988 RED Fieros (GT,Formula,coupe) up to Toronto with my 42 ft. Airstream Motorcoach. That way you could see for yourself all my RED Fieros and we could also have some fun running them and playing around Toronto.<P>Although I was hoping (you do have a passport?) that we could chart a flight through say Morocco, France then Italy while having you home by say Monday evening. Either <BR>way as long as I get to meet you in person.<P>So let me know! <P>See U Soon  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Sweet Dreams<P>BBTs||||reg||6
