Z||000206||Eric||02-02-2001||01:21 AM||||Alright, I think I've read/know enough about our little hottie to make some educated guesses about what she looks like and what her mental state is.  Let me start off by saying, this probably isn't a joke.  No person in their right mind would take this subject to the point where it is now.  I also believe there are little or no untruths in hottie's posts.  She is a she, not a he.  A predator looking for Fiero driving young boys would be scared away by the attention given to this thread.  Now for the good stuff...<P>1. Hottie is good looking.  I know what you all are thinking, how can I tell without seeing what she looks like?  Well, first off, she is confident enough to post in a strange forum, which she knows is populated almost entirly of heterosexual males under the name Hottie.  She has kind of agreed to meet some of us which proves she's not totally full of $hit.  And, finally, she works as a waitress.  The majority of waitresses being at least okay looking.  That being said, I will now expertly guess what she looks like if for no other reason than to give Derek and Steve an idea of who she is.<BR>-5 foot 5 and 1/2 inches tall<BR>-114 lbs<BR>-medium brown hair, longish<BR>-obviously thin, but in good physical condition<BR>-pretty, but not too pretty so as to make her a target or to make any of her companions uncomfortable.<P>2. She runs her mouth too much.  This gets her into trouble a lot.  She misses out on opportunity just because she blurts out mindless phrases without regard to consequence.  <P>She's a party girl.  She likes to get drunk and stoned a lot.  She's always looking for another stupid guy to hook up with, but her misguided attempts at finding Mr Right always end up in the same destructive way.<P>She doesn't have many female friends.  In fact, she doesn't have many friends at all.  Other girls resent her for being slutty.  But she acts this way to gain respect from them, not realizing this destroys any relationship she may have with other women.<P>Now that I've probed deep within the mind of this girl, I'll leave you with an explaination of my own reason for picking on her.  I am, by nature, a bully.  Although I'm not physically imposing, I will do things that can be though of, by better people than I, as ethically wrong and with the intent to cause unnessessary pain and suffering.  There is a certain line we all have to draw for ourselves which defines what we will and what we won't do to further our own personal intrests.  Hottie has crossed most people's line and, therefore, made herself subject to personal attacks by myself and others.  My deduction of this person was mostly for entertainment purposes; however, I felt justified in slamming her mainly because this thread has wasted so much of my time.  I think a final jab is all it should take to bring this giant down.  Call me a dick or a loser if you must; I'll take it all smiling  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
